Local optional ACM console for usb-signaller v0.4.2.
Upstream: https://codeberg.org/DylanVanAssche/usb-signaller/src/tag/v0.4.2

USB_SIGNALLER_ACM=1 adds ACM only to developer mode, before binding the UDC.
NCM stays present. Identify NCM independently of configfs directory order;
ACM may be the first function. Generic deletion already unlinks all functions.

